  m_text: "MISSION 2 - \u201CHIGHWAY TO HELL\u201D\n\nYOU MANAGED TO CLEAR OUT THE
    MILITARY BASE. WELL DONE PILOT.\n\nYOUR NEXT OBJECTIVE:\n\nYOU ARE TO FOLLOW
    THE HIGHWAY TO REACH THE TUNNEL ON THE OTHER SIDE. \n\nTHE ROADS AND SURROUNDINGS
    HAVE NOT BEEN MAINTAINED IN MANY MONTHS, AND THE BUGS CONSTANT DIGGING HAS CAUSED
    MANY ROCKSLIDES IN THE AREA, SO BE CAREFUL."
